	"locales": {
		"hu": {
			"subject": "Eltérést jelzett a havi összesítőben: {{employeeName}} ({{periodLabel}})",
			"html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n\t<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n\t<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\t<title>Eltérés a havi szabadság-összesítőben</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f4f5;\">\n\t<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #f4f4f5;\">\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" style=\"padding: 48px 24px;\">\n\t\t\t\t<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width: 520px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" style=\"padding: 32px 32px 24px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #3b82f6;\">{{appNameHtml}}</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"padding: 0 32px 24px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h1 style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; color: #18181b; text-align: center;\">Eltérés a havi szabadság-összesítőben</h1>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #52525b;\">Kedves {{recipientNameHtml}}!</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0 0 24px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #52525b;\"><strong>{{employeeNameHtml}}</strong> a(z) <strong>{{organizationNameHtml}}</strong> szervezetben eltérést jelzett a(z) {{periodLabel}} havi szabadság-összesítőjében.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #f9fafb; border-radius: 6px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"padding: 16px 20px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #52525b; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;\">A jelzett eltérések</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t{{itemsHtml}}{{noteHtml}}\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0 0 24px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #52525b;\">A szabadság-nyilvántartó csapatnézetében javíthatod a naptárat és újraküldheted az összesítőt, vagy indoklással lezárhatod az ellenőrzést.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" style=\"padding: 0 0 8px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"{{appUrl}}\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 12px 24px; background-color: #3b82f6; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 500; font-size: 14px;\">Szabadság-nyilvántartó megnyitása</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"padding: 24px 32px; border-top: 1px solid #e4e4e7;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 12px; color: #a1a1aa; text-align: center;\">Ezt az emailt azért kaptad, mert te küldted ki az ellenőrzést, vagy a(z) {{appName}} rendszerben értesítést kapsz a szabadságkérelmekről.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</table>\n</body>\n</html>",
			"text": "Kedves {{recipientName}}!\n\n{{employeeName}} a(z) {{organizationName}} szervezetben eltérést jelzett a(z) {{periodLabel}} havi szabadság-összesítőjében.\n\nA jelzett eltérések:\n{{itemsText}}\n{{noteText}}\nA szabadság-nyilvántartó csapatnézetében javíthatod a naptárat és újraküldheted az összesítőt, vagy indoklással lezárhatod az ellenőrzést: {{appUrl}}\n\nEzt az emailt azért kaptad, mert te küldted ki az ellenőrzést, vagy a(z) {{appName}} rendszerben értesítést kapsz a szabadságkérelmekről.\n\n{{appName}}"
		},
		"en": {
			"subject": "Discrepancy reported in a monthly summary: {{employeeName}} ({{periodLabel}})",
			"html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n\t<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n\t<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\t<title>Discrepancy in a monthly leave summary</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f4f5;\">\n\t<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #f4f4f5;\">\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" style=\"padding: 48px 24px;\">\n\t\t\t\t<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width: 520px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" style=\"padding: 32px 32px 24px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #3b82f6;\">{{appNameHtml}}</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"padding: 0 32px 24px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h1 style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; color: #18181b; text-align: center;\">Discrepancy in a monthly leave summary</h1>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #52525b;\">Dear {{recipientNameHtml}},</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0 0 24px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #52525b;\"><strong>{{employeeNameHtml}}</strong> in <strong>{{organizationNameHtml}}</strong> reported a discrepancy in their leave summary for {{periodLabel}}.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #f9fafb; border-radius: 6px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"padding: 16px 20px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #52525b; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;\">Reported discrepancies</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t{{itemsHtml}}{{noteHtml}}\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0 0 24px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #52525b;\">In the team view of the leave register you can fix the calendar and resend the summary, or close the check with a reason.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" style=\"padding: 0 0 8px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"{{appUrl}}\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 12px 24px; background-color: #3b82f6; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 500; font-size: 14px;\">Open the leave register</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"padding: 24px 32px; border-top: 1px solid #e4e4e7;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 12px; color: #a1a1aa; text-align: center;\">You received this email because you sent the check, or you are notified about leave requests in {{appName}}.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</table>\n</body>\n</html>",
			"text": "Dear {{recipientName}},\n\n{{employeeName}} in {{organizationName}} reported a discrepancy in their leave summary for {{periodLabel}}.\n\nReported discrepancies:\n{{itemsText}}\n{{noteText}}\nIn the team view of the leave register you can fix the calendar and resend the summary, or close the check with a reason: {{appUrl}}\n\nYou received this email because you sent the check, or you are notified about leave requests in {{appName}}.\n\n{{appName}}"
		}
	}
